66248575],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.8608,"reading_order":9,"text":"• Ask a voice question in the local language and play the spoken answer."},{"block_id":"p5-b10","coordinates":{"x1":264,"y1":1954,"x2":1262,"y2":2006},"bbox_norm":[0.10640870616686819,0.557012542759407,0.5086658605401048,0.571835803876853],"layout_tag":"paragraph","confidence":0.8477,"reading_order":10,"text":"• Close with the accuracy numbers from the test set."},{"block_id":"p5-b11","coordinates":{"x1":253,"y1":2076,"x2":1013,"y2":2148},"bbox_norm":[0.10197501007658202,0.5917901938426454,0.4083031035872632,0.6123147092360319],"layout_tag":"section-title","confidence":0.895,"reading_order":11,"text":"12. Risks and mitigations"},{"block_id":"p5-b12","coordinates":{"x1":228,"y1":2170,"x2":2240,"y2":2736},"bbox_norm":[0.09189842805320435,0.6185860889395667,0.9028617492946392,0.7799315849486887],"layout_tag":"table","confidence":0.9619,"reading_order":12,"text":"\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRisk\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMitigation\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003ePoor OCR on bad photos\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eTest early with real phone pictures; add a retake prompt and preprocessing.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eHallucinated dates or amounts\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eValidate with code against the extracted text; show confidence flags.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eSensitive personal data\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eNo storage beyond the session; delete after use; state this clearly.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eScope creep\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eFreeze features at hour 16; polish one flow instead of adding more.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eVoice latency in demo\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003ePre-test audio, keep answers short, have a recorded backup.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e"},{"block_id":"p5-b13","coordin